  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1177665458825089125/ec_aquaculture_plugin_title.png\" alt=\"Заголовок плагина Expanded Combat Aquaculture\" width=\"445\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ec-aquaculture-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"Требует Cloth Config API\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/curios\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152401406247047188/curios_api_64h.png\" alt=\"Требует Curios API\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/expanded-combat\" >\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152636014880366763/expanded_combat_64h.png\" alt=\"Требует Expanded Combat\" width=\"288\"/>\n    </a>\n <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1177665503511199894/aquaculture_64h.png\" alt=\"Требует Aquaculture\" width=\"224\" height=\"56\" /></a></p>\n</center>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Плагин-мод для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/expanded-combat\">Expanded Combat</a>&nbsp;, обеспечивающий совместимость с материалом Нептунит из&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer\">Aquaculture</a>.</p>\n<h4>Добавляет поддержку материала:</h4>\n<p>Нептунит:&nbsp; включает в себя колчаны, оружие, перчатки и щиты, добавленные моим основным модом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/expanded-combat\">Expanded Combat</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\nНажмите на баннер, чтобы получить скидку:\n<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/userofbricks\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/91cdbb92-a3db-4f62-a182-239fe5589b2a.webp\" alt=\"Промо-баннер Bisect Hosting\">\n    </a>",
